              "name": "Why",
              "fill": "$outline-variant",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Four decorative layers, all aria-hidden. Two are repeating patterns the canvas cannot tile: a 40px dot grid (accent at 6%) drifting one cell over 20s, and a 1px/3px line texture in rgba(0,0,0,.22). The glow (accent 9%, breathe 4s) and the sweep (accent 18%, top to bottom over 6s) are drawn static above. Under prefers-reduced-motion the grid, the glow and the caret stop moving and the sweep is removed outright.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono-render",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
